In this article, we review Flag namespace in Opencode codebase. We will look at:
Flag namespace


Flag usage




I study patterns used in an open source project found on Github Trending. For this week, I reviewed some parts of opencode codebase and wrote this article.

You will find the following definition in opencode/packages/opencode/src/flag/flag.ts.
